    <entry>
      <title>[VSCode 學習筆記] - 創建及使用程式碼片段</title>
      <link href="/blog/post/vscode-snippets.html"/>
      <url>/blog/post/vscode-snippets.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>程式碼片段 (Code Snippets) 是許多整合開發環境軟件 (IDE) 都會提供的功能，它可讓開發者<strong>快速輸入常用的程式碼</strong>，以<strong>提高開發效率</strong>。在本文中，我們會使用 VSCode 來學習如何創建及使用程式碼片段，若你是在使用其他文本編輯器或 IDE，編寫程式碼片段的概念其實大同小異，可作參考。</p><p>雖然 VSCode 不是一個 IDE，而是一個文本編輯器，但借助延伸模組的支援，許多開發語言集成模組 (Language Integration Extensions) 都會提供附建的程式碼片段，透過多元的智能代碼補全 (IntelliSense)，使 VSCode 逐漸變得強大，可謂雨後春筍。</p><p><img src="https://code.visualstudio.com/assets/docs/editor/userdefinedsnippets/ajax-snippet.gif" alt="使用程式碼片段產生通用程式碼"></p><p>不過，即使部分開發語言集成模組提供了程式碼片段，有時候也會覺得限制多多（<strong>始終是別人寫，人家不知道你的要求</strong>），因此，我們可以創建自訂的程式碼片段，當有更大的需求時，我們也可以隨時修改，以彰顯程式碼片段的威力，同時亦把自己的慵懶發揮得淋漓盡致。。。</p><h1 id="創建程式碼片段"><a href="#創建程式碼片段" class="headerlink" title="創建程式碼片段"></a>創建程式碼片段</h1><p>首先開啟 VSCode，在「檢視」 &gt; 「命令選擇區」開啟命令選擇區。</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img1.png" alt="開啟命令選擇區"></p><p>在命令選擇區內輸入 <code>snippets</code> 以搜尋「程式碼片段：設定程式碼片段」，並點擊它。</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img2.png" alt="命令選擇區內輸入並搜尋 snippets"></p><p>接着，你會看到這個視窗，你可以因應需求，選擇全域還是在當前工作區內新增程式碼片段檔案。</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img3.png" alt="透過全域或當前工作區創建程式碼片段檔案"></p><div class="tabs" id="none"><ul class="nav-tabs"><li class="tab active"><button type="button" data-href="#none-0">當前工作區</button></li><li class="tab"><button type="button" data-href="#none-1">全域</button></li></ul><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active" id="none-0"><p>在當前工作區，即是<strong>只有當前項目可使用</strong>，通常是為<strong>項目的功能所需而編寫的程式碼片段</strong>，例如我撰寫 Hexo 網誌，除了編寫全域 Markdown 程式碼片段外，也會在工作區編寫標籤外掛的程式碼片段，方便撰寫內容。</p><p>當前工作區會自動產生 <code>.vscode</code> 目錄，裏面存放了剛才所建的程式碼片段檔案，該檔案亦自動寫入了官方的指引。</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img6.png" alt="當前工作區自動產生本地程式碼片段檔案"></p><button type="button" class="tab-to-top" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="solitude fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div><div class="tab-item-content" id="none-1"><p>在所有工作區內都可使用，即是整個 VSCode 軟件<strong>開啟任何項目都可使用</strong>，這些通常是<strong>為特定語言編寫通用的程式碼片段</strong>，例如，我自己編寫了 Markdown 的程式碼片段，檔案為 <code>markdown.code-snippets</code>。</p><p>如果你想找到全域程式碼片段的儲存位置，你可以先開啟 <code>settings.json</code>，然後在檔案路徑導覽列中找出 <code>snippets</code> 目錄，裏面就是所創建的全域程式碼片段。</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img4.png" alt="查找全域程式碼片段檔案的存放位置"></p><button type="button" class="tab-to-top" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="solitude fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div></div><p>選擇全域還是當前工作區後，輸入程式碼片段的檔案名稱，例如 <code>my-snippets</code>。</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img5.png" alt="輸入程式碼片段檔案名稱"></p><h1 id="編寫程式碼片段"><a href="#編寫程式碼片段" class="headerlink" title="編寫程式碼片段"></a>編寫程式碼片段</h1><p>你可以使用 <a href="https://snippet-generator.app/">snippet-generator</a> 輕鬆創建程式碼片段，然後把寫好的內容貼上到程式碼片段檔案內。如果你不太熟悉或嫌麻煩寫 JSON 語法，可以使用這個工具，採用人性化的介面建立程式碼片段。</p><p>你也可以直接編輯程式碼片段檔案，依照官方指引及格式，透過 JSON 語法編寫。</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img7.png" alt="使用 snippet-generator 創建程式碼片段"></p><ul><li><code>Description</code>：程式碼片段的描述，說明這個程式碼片段產生的程式碼的主要用途。</li><li><code>Tab Trigger</code>：對應 JSON 的 <code>prefix</code> 屬性，用作設置觸發程式碼片段的前置詞。</li><li><code>Your snippet</code>：對應 JSON 的 <code>body</code> 屬性，用作設置程式碼片段的內容。</li></ul><div class="alertbox alertbox-warning"><p>snippet-generator 讓你輕易創建簡單的程式碼片段，所以功能有限制，當你需要設置其他屬性時，你還是需要手動編輯程式碼片段檔案。</p></div><p>現在先試試編寫一個比較簡單的 JavaScript 程式碼片段。</p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">"Hello message"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"prefix"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"hello"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"body"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">"console.log('Hello World');"</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"description"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"Outputs a message to the console"</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>建立一個 JavaScript 檔案，然後輸入前置詞 <code>hello</code>，你會在自動補全選單中找到這個程式碼片段：</p><p>黃框的是程式碼片段的名稱，藍框是程式碼片段的描述。</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img8.png" alt="輸入前置詞的自動補全選單的過程顯示"></p><div class="alertbox alertbox-note"><p>在 <code>body</code> 中，我們可以輸入多行程式碼，但要留意，<strong>每一行都是獨立的字串</strong>。</p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">"Hello message"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"prefix"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"hello"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"body"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">"console.log('Hello World');"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">"console.log('This is my script');"</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"description"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"Outputs a message to the console"</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div><h2 id="設置作用域"><a href="#設置作用域" class="headerlink" title="設置作用域"></a>設置作用域</h2><p>在剛才編寫的程式碼片段中，如果你嘗試在非 JavaScript 檔案中輸入 <code>hello</code> 前置詞，這個程式碼片段還是會觸發的。就像下方所示的 HTML 檔案中：</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img9.png" alt="在無關的檔案使用程式碼片段"></p><p>那就彆扭了，因為我們希望這個程式碼片段只會在 JavaScript 檔案中觸發時，但是它偏偏要在無關檔案都一樣觸發，這時候我們就要為程式碼片段設置作用域。設置作用域有兩種：</p><div class="tabs" id="none"><ul class="nav-tabs"><li class="tab active"><button type="button" data-href="#none-0">特定檔案</button></li><li class="tab"><button type="button" data-href="#none-1">特定編程語言</button></li></ul><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active" id="none-0"><p>當你想限制程式碼片段只能在特定檔案中使用，如下：</p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">"Hello message"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"prefix"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"hello"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"body"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">"console.log('Hello World');"</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"description"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"Outputs a message to the console"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"scope"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"index.js, app.js, script.js"</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>這個程式碼片段只有 <code>index.js</code>、<code>app.js</code> 及 <code>script.js</code> 可使用， 不是這些名稱的其他 JavaScript 檔案，皆不能使用。</p><button type="button" class="tab-to-top" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="solitude fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div><div class="tab-item-content" id="none-1"><p>當你想限制程式碼片段只能在特定語言使用，如下：</p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">"Hello message"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"prefix"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"hello"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"body"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">"console.log('Hello World');"</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"description"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"Outputs a message to the console"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"scope"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"javascript, typescript"</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>這個程式碼片段只有 JavaScript 及 TypeScript 檔案可使用，其他編程語言皆不能使用。</p><div class="alertbox alertbox-warning"><p>理論上，<strong>檔案及語法高亮模式理應是吻合的</strong>，但不排除有其他使用情況，所以這裏說一下：</p><p>這裏的<strong>編程語言作用域</strong>設置，是取決於 <strong>VSCode 當前啟用的檔案所使用的語言</strong>及語法高亮，所以即使檔案並非 JavaScript 檔案，只要語法高亮模式啟用 JavaScript，這個程式碼片段也可使用。</p><p>例如 <code>index.html</code> 檔案啟用 JavaScript 語法高亮，這個程式碼片段也可使用。</p></div><button type="button" class="tab-to-top" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="solitude fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div></div><h2 id="設置佔位符"><a href="#設置佔位符" class="headerlink" title="設置佔位符"></a>設置佔位符</h2><p>一個程式碼片段的好用程度是在於它彈性如否，就像我們<strong>現在剛才寫的程式碼片段就是不好用</strong>，因為 <code>console.log()</code> 內的值固定了「Hello World」，如果我們能夠在插入程式碼片段後，游標會停留在 <code>console.log()</code> 函數括號內供我們輸入內容，那麼這個程式碼片段便會好用很多。</p><p>有了這個想法後，我們可以在 <code>body</code> 屬性內使用 <code>$</code> 設置佔位符。</p><ul><li><code>$0</code>：用於設置游標的最終位置，<strong>不一定需要</strong>，因為如果沒有使用 <code>$0</code> 特別指明該位置，會<strong>以程式碼片段的最後一個字元</strong>為最終位置。</li><li><code>$1</code>、<code>$2</code> …：用於設置作用域需停留的位置。</li></ul><p>而每一個佔位符，都可以按 <kbd style="border:1px solid gray;font-size:1.2em;box-shadow: 1px 0 1px 0 var(--efu-secondbg), 0 2px 0 2px var(--efu-secondbg), 0 2px 0 3px var(--efu-secondtext);-webkit-border-radius:3px;-moz-border-radius:3px;border-radius:3px;margin:2px 3px;padding:1px 5px;">Tab</kbd> 鍵，來切換游標位置，直至游標到達最終位置，<kbd style="border:1px solid gray;font-size:1.2em;box-shadow: 1px 0 1px 0 var(--efu-secondbg), 0 2px 0 2px var(--efu-secondbg), 0 2px 0 3px var(--efu-secondtext);-webkit-border-radius:3px;-moz-border-radius:3px;border-radius:3px;margin:2px 3px;padding:1px 5px;">⇧Shift</kbd> + <kbd style="border:1px solid gray;font-size:1.2em;box-shadow: 1px 0 1px 0 var(--efu-secondbg), 0 2px 0 2px var(--efu-secondbg), 0 2px 0 3px var(--efu-secondtext);-webkit-border-radius:3px;-moz-border-radius:3px;border-radius:3px;margin:2px 3px;padding:1px 5px;">Tab</kbd> 鍵則可以反向切換游標位置。</p><div class="tabs" id="none"><ul class="nav-tabs"><li class="tab active"><button type="button" data-href="#none-0">隱式佔位符</button></li><li class="tab"><button type="button" data-href="#none-1">顯式佔位符</button></li></ul><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active" id="none-0"><p>當程式碼片段只需要一個佔位符，通常也是一些較簡單的程式碼，你可以不需要指明佔位符名稱。</p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">"Console log"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"prefix"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"log"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"body"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">"console.log('$1');"</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"description"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"Outputs a message to the console"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"scope"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"javascript, typescript"</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><button type="button" class="tab-to-top" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="solitude fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div><div class="tab-item-content" id="none-1"><p>當程式碼片段插入的程式碼過於複雜時，我們需要指明佔位符名稱，說明佔位符的作用，讓開發者易於理解。現在我假設開發者是小白，他並不知道 <code>console.log()</code> 裏面需要輸入什麼，我們可以幫助他：</p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">"Console log"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"prefix"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"log"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"body"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">"console.log('${1:message}');"</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"description"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"Outputs a message to the console"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"scope"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"javascript, typescript"</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><button type="button" class="tab-to-top" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="solitude fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div></div><p>這個佔位符名稱亦可作為預設值，因為這個佔位符名稱是會直接寫入到程式碼內的，如下：</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img10.png" alt="佔位符名稱可作為預設值"></p><p>高亮的部分是代表該部分仍在編輯狀態，即是還可以輸入其他字修改它。</p><h2 id="設置選項"><a href="#設置選項" class="headerlink" title="設置選項"></a>設置選項</h2><p>雖然我們可以使用佔位符，為 <code>console.log()</code> 輸入字串，，但是佔位符只能靠我們手動輸入，無法為程式碼加入一些可提供的功能（而開發者可能不知曉的）。而且有時候我們不是想用 <code>log()</code> 函數的，需知道 <code>console</code> 物件還有其他函數，如 <code>info()</code>、<code>warn()</code>、<code>error()</code> 等等，那麼我們可以把它們新增為選項，預設使用 <code>log()</code> 函數，讓這個程式碼片段的可用性大增。</p><p>使用 <code>${1|選項1,選項2|}</code> 語法設置選項，這個語法只能適用於顯式佔位。</p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tbody><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">"Console message"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"prefix"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"con"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"body"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">[</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="string">"console.${1|log,warn,error,info,debug|}('$2');"</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">]</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"description"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"Outputs a message to the console"</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">"scope"</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">"javascript, typescript"</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">}</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>那麼，你便可以在自動補全選單中，按情況而選用合適的程式碼：</p><p><img src="/blog/blog/post/vscode-snippets/img11.png" alt="自動補全選單中顯示可用的函數"></p><p>好了，你需要知道的基本程式碼片段技巧大概就這樣吧，其實它還有許多進階功能，你可以看 <a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/userdefinedsnippets">VSCode 程式碼片段官方文檔</a>瞭解更多。希望這篇文章對你有幫助，可以提升你的開發效率。</p>]]></content>
      
      
